flowchart TD
    I[Input validation] --> R[Structured routing]
    R -->|retrieval| RT[MCP retrieval]
    R -->|calculator| CA[MCP calculator]
    R -->|combined| CO[Calculator then retrieval]
    R -->|out of scope| OO[Safe refusal]
    R -->|missing parameters / over limit| CL[Clarification]
    RT --> A[Answer generation]
    CA --> A
    CO --> A
    A --> V[Citation + semantic verification]
    V -->|supported| S[Return cited answer]
    V -->|unsupported / insufficient| F[Fail closed]
    OO --> E[Final response]
    CL --> E
    S --> E
    F --> E
